# Runtime output directory. Story-scoped folders are written here:
# .ai/story-agent/outputs/stories/<id>/story.md
# .ai/story-agent/outputs/stories/<id>/explanation.md
# .ai/story-agent/outputs/stories/<id>/analysis.md
# .ai/story-agent/outputs/stories/<id>/decisions.md
# .ai/story-agent/outputs/stories/<id>/plan.md
# .ai/story-agent/outputs/stories/<id>/execution-state.json
# .ai/story-agent/outputs/stories/<id>/validation.md
# .ai/story-agent/outputs/stories/<id>/manual-todo.md
# .ai/story-agent/outputs/stories/<id>/attachments/
# .ai/story-agent/outputs/stories/<id>/design/
#
# Everything under stories/ is gitignored. Do not commit client data.
